# Design System

Read `DESIGN.md`. Import tokens from `@/theme` — **no inline hex or magic numbers**.

```typescript
import { colors, spacing, typography, touch, radius } from '@/theme';
```

## Stitch: Playful Tactile Minimalism

- Light mode, mobile-first, 20px side margins
- Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans (headlines), Be Vietnam Pro (body)
- 3D-offset buttons (4px press), 2pt strokes, 16px card radius
- Inputs: 56px height; focus stroke → `colors.tertiaryContainer`

## Blueprint Overrides (interaction)

- Invisible Grid: no pieces after vanish
- Training: text only; matches: voice-first
- Clock freeze on parser failure; disambiguation: massive targets
- Fog: `1 - (interactions / threshold)`

## Components — Reuse First

1. Search `apps/mobile/components/` and `DESIGN.md` catalog before writing new UI
2. Reuse `PrimaryButton`, `MoveInput`, `Card`, `ProgressBar`, etc. — never duplicate styled markup
3. Extract to `components/ui/` or domain folder when pattern appears 2+ times or screen JSX exceeds ~150 lines
4. `screens/` compose components only; shared logic → `hooks/`
5. Presentational components: props in, JSX out — no data fetching

## No Stitch Frame?

Infer visuals from the nearest sibling Stitch screen + `@/theme`. Reuse existing components — never invent new colors, fonts, or button styles. Interaction from blueprint. Flag `// TODO(stitch):` on the file. See `DESIGN.md` § Screens without a Stitch frame.

## Accessibility

WCAG 2.2 AA. Use `colors.contrastInk` on colored surfaces. Pair color with text/icons.
